  "decision_conditions": [
    "By reason of the loss of commercial floorspace within the designated Ace of Spades Local Centre, in the absence of marketing evidence demonstrating a lack of continued need over a period of up to two years, and the lack of information to demonstrate that the retained commercial unit would remain functionally viable, the proposal is contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework, Policy SD6 of the London Plan 2021, and Core Strategy Policy DM17. \r\r",
    "By reason of the undersized gross internal area for the proposed ground floor dwelling, the lack of private external amenity space, and the compromised privacy and outlook from the primary habitable room windows, the proposal would fail to provide an adequate standard of residential accommodation for future occupiers, contrary to Policy D6 of the London Plan 2021, Core Strategy Policy DM10, and the Residential Design Supplementary Planning Document."
  ],
